abstract: >-
  KAV is a domain-agnostic research orchestrator that attaches to host systems
  via a minimal JSON Schema contract, runs a hypothesis-to-evidence loop with
  project-local memory, and enforces a five-law constitution including sovereign
  host evaluation and lineage-traced findings.
